│ known. METHOD One hundred and fifty-eight subjects, from a randomized controlled trial of CBT plus medication and    │
│ clinical management versus medication and clinical management alone, were followed 6 years after randomization (4    │
│ 1/2 years after completion of CBT) and the longitudinal course assessed. RESULTS Effects in prevention of relapse    │
│ and recurrence were found to persist, with weakening, and were not fully lost until 3 1/2 years after the end of     │
